Bill’s General Goods
- Buy
	- Disguise - $XXX
		if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
			do Inventory.add_item("Disguise")
		else:
			Not enough money
	- Saw - $XXX
		if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
			do Inventory.add_item("Saw")
		else:
			Not enough money
	- Crowbar - $XXX
		if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
			do Inventory.add_item("Crowbar")
		else:
			Not enough money
	- Tent - $XXX
		if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
			do Inventory.add_item("Tent")
		else:
			Not enough money
	- Catalytic Converter - $XXX | [if {catalytic_sold} == false] [else="hide"]
		if {Global.player_money} >= 100:
			do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
			set {catalytic_sold} = true
		
		else:
			Not enough money
- Sell
- Ask for Shelter - $XXX
	if {Global.player_money} < 100:
		Not enough money
	else:
		He gives you shelter
- Rob the Store
	if {Inventory.has_item("Gun")} and {Global.current_resolve()} <= 50.0:
		You attempt to rob the store. With you looking disheveled and sickly, the storeowner Bill quickly notices and immediately lunges at you like a mighty tiger. He quickly disarms you and shoots you in the head. You are dead.
	elif {Inventory.has_item("Gun")} and {Global.current_resolve()} >= 51.0:
		Successfully rob the place
		do Global.close_store()
	else:
		Great job trying to rob the store without a gun. You are dead bozo.